{"id":"botons-i-inputs-de-formulari","title":"Botons i inputs de formulari","topic":"html","topicLabel":"HTML","tags":["aprendizaje","html"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":1,"words":97,"backlinks":[{"id":"sesion-11-22-05-26","title":"Sesion_11_22.05.26","topicLabel":"JavaScript","session":11}],"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Per fer que l&#39;usuari pugui interactuar amb la pàgina (com fer clic o escriure text), utilitzem els botons i els camps d&#39;entrada (<em>inputs</em>). En una calculadora, necessitem un <code>input</code> que serveixi com a &quot;pantalla&quot; (on es mostren els números i resultats) i múltiples etiquetes <code>button</code> (o <code>input type=&quot;button&quot;</code>) on l&#39;usuari farà clic per introduir les dades.</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">html</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Pantalla de la calculadora (només lectura perquè l&#x27;usuari no hi escrigui directament amb el teclat) --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;text&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;display&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;display&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">readonly</span>&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- Botons interactius --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btn&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onclick</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;clearDisplay()&quot;</span>&gt;</span>C<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btn&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onclick</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;appendNumber(&#x27;7&#x27;)&quot;</span>&gt;</span>7<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;btn btn-operator&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">onclick</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;appendOperator(&#x27;+&#x27;)&quot;</span>&gt;</span>+<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">button</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div>"}